# Testing with Vitest + CDK assertions

- Use `aws-cdk-lib/assertions` (`Template.fromStack`).
- Runner is Vitest via Vite+ (`pnpm test` / `vp test run`; official docs examples use Jest).
- Include fine-grained, snapshot, and security/negative assertions for CDK.
- Dashboard tests live under `dashboard/src/**/*.test.{ts,tsx}`.
- Run `pnpm test` after changes; finish with `pnpm agent:check`.
